{"suttaId":"tha-ap391","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[11085,11127],"vripara":"49"},"segments":{"tha-ap391:0.3":"Soṇakoṭivīsattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap391:1.1":"“Vipassino pāvacane,","tha-ap391:1.2":"ekaṃ leṇaṃ mayā kataṃ;","tha-ap391:1.3":"Cātuddisassa saṅghassa,","tha-ap391:1.4":"bandhumārājadhāniyā.","tha-ap391:2.1":"“Dussehi bhūmiṃ leṇassa,","tha-ap391:2.2":"santharitvā pariccajiṃ;","tha-ap391:2.3":"Udaggacitto sumano,","tha-ap391:2.4":"akāsiṃ paṇidhiṃ tadā.","tha-ap391:3.1":"“Ārādhayeyyaṃ sambuddhaṃ,","tha-ap391:3.2":"pabbajjañca labheyyahaṃ;","tha-ap391:3.3":"Anuttarañca nibbānaṃ,","tha-ap391:3.4":"phuseyyaṃ santimuttamaṃ.","tha-ap391:4.1":"“Teneva sukkamūlena,","tha-ap391:4.2":"kappe [kappaṃ (sī.), kappa (ka.)] navuti saṃsariṃ;","tha-ap391:4.3":"Devabhūto manusso ca,","tha-ap391:4.4":"katapuñño virocahaṃ.","tha-ap391:5.1":"“Tato kammāvasesena,","tha-ap391:5.2":"idha pacchimake bhave;","tha-ap391:5.3":"Campāyaṃ aggaseṭṭhissa,","tha-ap391:5.4":"jātomhi ekaputtako.","tha-ap391:6.1":"“Jātamattassa me sutvā,","tha-ap391:6.2":"pitu chando ayaṃ ahu;","tha-ap391:6.3":"Dadāmahaṃ kumārassa,","tha-ap391:6.4":"vīsakoṭī anūnakā.","tha-ap391:7.1":"“Caturaṅgulā ca me lomā,","tha-ap391:7.2":"jātā pādatale ubho;","tha-ap391:7.3":"Sukhumā mudusamphassā,","tha-ap391:7.4":"tūlāpicusamā subhā.","tha-ap391:8.1":"“Atītā navuti kappā,","tha-ap391:8.2":"ayaṃ eko ca uttari;","tha-ap391:8.3":"Nābhijānāmi nikkhitte,","tha-ap391:8.4":"pāde bhūmyā asanthate.","tha-ap391:9.1":"“Ārādhito me sambuddho,","tha-ap391:9.2":"pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","tha-ap391:9.3":"Arahattañca me pattaṃ,","tha-ap391:9.4":"sītibhūtomhi nibbuto.","tha-ap391:10.1":"“Aggo āraddhavīriyānaṃ,","tha-ap391:10.2":"niddiṭṭho sabbadassinā;","tha-ap391:10.3":"Khīṇāsavomhi arahā,","tha-ap391:10.4":"chaḷabhiñño mahiddhiko.","tha-ap391:11.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe,","tha-ap391:11.2":"yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap391:11.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi,","tha-ap391:11.4":"leṇadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap391:12.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe …","tha-ap391:12.3":"viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap391:13.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe …","tha-ap391:13.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap391:14.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe …","tha-ap391:14.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap391:15.1":"“Thero koṭivīso [koṭiviso (syā. ka.), koḷiviso (aññaṭṭhānesu)] soṇo,","tha-ap391:15.2":"bhikkhusaṅghassa aggato;","tha-ap391:15.3":"Pañhaṃ puṭṭho viyākāsi,","tha-ap391:15.4":"anotatte mahāsare”ti.","tha-ap391:16.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā soṇo koṭivīso thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap391:17.1":"Soṇakoṭivīsattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3290,"to":3290,"paras":[{"para":3290,"vripara":"49","refs":["tha-ap391:1"],"lines":["So arahā hutvā attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>vipassino pāvacane</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha <b>vipassī</b>ti visesena, vividhaṃ vā passatīti vipassī.","<b>Pāvacane</b>ti pakārena vuccatīti pāvacanaṃ, piṭakattayaṃ.","Tassa vipassino tasmiṃ pāvacaneti attho.","<b>Leṇan</b>ti linante nilīyante etthāti leṇaṃ vihāraṃ.","<b>Bandhumārājadhāniyā</b>ti bandhanti kulaparamparāya vasena aññamaññaṃ sambajjhantīti bandhū, ñātakā.","Te ettha paṭivasantīti bandhumā, bandhu assa atthīti vā bandhumā.","Rājūnaṃ vasanaṭṭhānanti rājadhānī, bandhumā ca sā rājadhānī ceti bandhumārājadhānī, tassā bandhumārājadhāniyā, leṇaṃ mayā katanti sambandho.","Sesamettha uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap391:1"],["tha-ap391:1"],["tha-ap391:1"],["tha-ap391:1"],["tha-ap391:1"],["tha-ap391:1"],["tha-ap391:1"],["tha-ap391:1"],["tha-ap391:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap391:1.1","vipassino pāvacane",0,0],["tha-ap391:1.1","vipassī",0,1],["tha-ap391:1.1","pāvacane",0,2],["tha-ap391:1.1","leṇaṃ",0,4],["tha-ap391:1.3","bandhumārājadhāniyā",0,5]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
